1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:03,029
(Penny:)what would you most regret
not having told someone?"

2
00:00:03,035 --> 00:00:05,805
(Sheldon:)So, it would be today?

3
00:00:05,805 --> 00:00:07,805
(Sheldon:)Huh.

4
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:09,807
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose there's
something satisfying

5
00:00:09,809 --> 00:00:12,539
(Sheldon:)about dying on my birthday.

6
00:00:12,545 --> 00:00:14,915
(Penny:)Today's your birthday?

7
00:00:14,914 --> 00:00:16,014
(Amy:)Yes.

8
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:18,085
(Raj:)Well, that's
always been a secret!

9
00:00:18,084 --> 00:00:20,054
Not even Amy knows!

10
00:00:20,052 --> 00:00:23,952
(Sheldon:)Well, I don't enjoy presents.

11
00:00:23,956 --> 00:00:25,456
(Sheldon:)And the thought of people

12
00:00:25,458 --> 00:00:27,858
(Sheldon:)jumping out and yelling
"Surprise!" fills me

13
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,930
(Sheldon:)with more dread than the words

14
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:32,999
"George Lucas Director's Cut."

15
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:35,369
(Penny:)So, why did you finally tell me?

16
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:38,198
(Sheldon:)The point of the experiment is

17
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:40,504
(Sheldon:)to be completely honest
with each other.

18
00:00:40,506 --> 00:00:43,406
(Penny:)Well, thank you
for sharing it with me.

19
00:00:43,409 --> 00:00:45,309
(Penny:)I won't tell anyone.

20
00:00:45,311 --> 00:00:47,141
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

21
00:00:47,146 --> 00:00:48,346
(Penny:)That is so funny.

22
00:00:48,347 --> 00:00:50,647
(Penny:)I never would have
pegged you for a Pisces.

23
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:53,580
(Sheldon:)You're making it difficult
to love you right now.

24
00:00:56,355 --> 00:00:58,455
Great news!
Your bag was returned.

25
00:00:58,457 --> 00:01:00,127
Oh, thank God!

